## Commands Used

### PowerShell

```powershell
.\LaZagne.exe all
ping google.com -t
Ctrl + C
```

### LimaCharlie API

```http
POST /v1/<oid>/sensor/<sid>/isolation
GET /v1/<oid>/sensor/<sid>
```

### Detection Rule Conditions

```yaml
FILE_PATH ends with "LaZagne.exe"
COMMAND_LINE ends with "all"
COMMAND_LINE contains "lazagne"
TARGET = windows
EVENT = NEW_PROCESS
EVENT = EXISTING_PROCESS
```
